{
  "response": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "translated": "Welcome to ProSeka AfterTalk: \"Our Survival Struggle\" edition! Yeah! And we're live!"
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "translated": "Um, kon-niigo, everyone! I'm Hinata Sato, the voice of Mizuki Akiyama from N25."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "translated": "This ProSeka AfterTalk is a program where we look back on the event story"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "translated": "and enjoy the AfterLive together with everyone watching."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "translated": "This time, we're covering the \"Our Survival Struggle\" event."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "translated": "It just ended yesterday, May 9th,"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "translated": "so I hope you all enjoyed the story and the music!"
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "translated": "I didn't realize the background would be this white, so wearing white today makes me look like a floating head, like that Gachapin green screen fail."
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "translated": "It looks like I'm filming a self-tape for an overseas audition or something, which is kind of funny, but the content itself..."
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "translated": "The N25 story is really getting into some deep territory now, so"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "translated": "I hope you'll all look back on it with me."
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "translated": "When you're posting your thoughts on the event or this stream, please use the hashtag #ProSekaAfterTalk."
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "translated": "The staff have set up the YouTube chat so I can see it right here, and I want to pick out some of your comments."
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "translated": "\"You're merging with the white.\""
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "translated": "I really am, aren't I?"
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "translated": "\"I love your bangs.\""
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "translated": "Thank you!"
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "translated": "There it is."
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "translated": "\"Surprisingly white.\""
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "translated": "Yeah, it's like a laundry detergent commercial."
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "translated": "Thanks for the comments."
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "translated": "Since Mizuki had straight hair this time, I decided to go with a sleek, straight look too. You can really see my mic now."
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "translated": "You get a great view of the lapel mic and my face."
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "translated": "I'd say it's a perfect composition."
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "translated": "I'll keep picking up comments like this as we go."
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "translated": "Also, the staff have provided me with a device to use today,"
    }
  ]
}

